 your actual keyword gaps</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#00b8db;font-weight:700;\">03 &#8212;</span> <strong>Free Audit</strong> &#8212; Your personalized visibility report in 60 seconds</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 0;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#00b8db;font-weight:700;\">04 &#8212;</span> <strong>Gadgetlesstech</strong> &#8212; The team that executes the full system for you</td></tr></table><p>First deep dive arrives in 2 days.</p><p style=\"margin:24px 0 0;\">&#8212; Kevin<br><span style=\"color:#999;font-size:13px;\">Gadgetlesstech</span></p><hr style=\"border:none;border-top:1px solid #eee;margin:28px 0;\"><p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#999;\">You received this because you requested the Gadgetlesstech Blueprint. <a href=\"#\" style=\"color:#00b8db;\">Unsubscribe</a></p></div></div></body></html>"
