        "subject": "Why 90% of your potential searches go unranked",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f5f5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><div style=\"max-width:580px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 20px;\"><div style=\"background:#000;padding:20px 28px;border-bottom:3px solid #00b8db;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;\"><p style=\"margin:0;color:#00b8db;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;\">The Why</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-weight:900;font-style:italic;letter-spacing:-1px;\">Query Expansion System&#8482;</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:32px 28px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;\"><p>Hey {{ $json.name || 'there' }},</p><p>You requested the blueprint because something about query expansion clicked. Let me go deeper.</p><p>Most businesses optimize for a fixed list of 10&#8211;30 keywords. That is the entire surface area of their SEO strategy. Their top local competitor? Ranking for 300&#8211;500 variations of those same searches.</p><p>When someone needs your service, they do not always type the same phrase. They search:</p><ul style=\"padding-left:20px;margin:0 0 16px;line-height:2.4;\"><li>the service name plus their city</li><li>a problem they are trying to solve</li><li>a question about cost, timing, or process</li><li>an emergency or urgent variation</li><li>a comparison against a competing option</li></ul><p>Each one is a separate ranking opportunity. Each one has intent. Each one represents a customer ready to act.</p><p>Query Expansion is the system for capturing all of them without creating a mountain of individual pages or bloating your content strategy.</p><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:24px 0;\"><tr><td style=\"background:#00b8db;border-radius:6px;\"><a href=\"https://queryexpansionsystem.com\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;color:#000;font-size:13px;font-weight:900;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;\">Read the Full Methodology &#8594;</a></td></tr></table><p>Next email: the real scale of the gap between you and your top competitor.</p><p style=\"margin:24px 0 0;\">&#8212; Kevin<br><span style=\"color:#999;font-size:13px;\">Gadgetlesstech</span></p><hr style=\"border:none;border-top:1px solid #eee;margin:28px 0;\"><p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#999;\">You received this because you requested the Gadgetlesstech Blueprint. <a href=\"#\" style=\"color:#00b8db;\">Unsubscribe</a></p></div></div></body></html>"
