        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f5f5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><div style=\"max-width:580px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 20px;\"><div style=\"background:#000;padding:20px 28px;border-bottom:3px solid #00b8db;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;\"><p style=\"margin:0;color:#00b8db;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;\">The Data</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-weight:900;font-style:italic;letter-spacing:-1px;\">Query Expansion System&#8482;</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:32px 28px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;\"><p>Hey {{ $json.name || 'there' }},</p><p>Here is a number worth sitting with:</p><div style=\"border-left:4px solid #00b8db;background:#f9f9f9;padding:20px;margin:20px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\">The average local business ranks for <strong>47 keywords.</strong></p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;\">Their top local competitor ranks for <strong style=\"color:#00b8db;\">430+.</strong></p></div><p>That is a 10x visibility gap &#8212; and it compounds every month you do not close it.</p><p>AI-powered search does not just surface the highest-ranking page. It surfaces the business with <strong>topical authority</strong> &#8212; the one that has demonstrated the broadest, deepest coverage of your subject area.</p><p>If you are ranking for 47 keywords, the algorithm does not see you as an authority. It sees you as a listing.</p><p>The businesses winning local search right now are using systems that compress hundreds of keyword variations into lean, structured content that signals authority at scale. That is the Gadgetlesstech approach.</p><p>In 3 days I will show you the free tool that makes this gap impossible to ignore.</p><p style=\"margin:24px 0 0;\">&#8212; Kevin<br><span style=\"color:#999;font-size:13px;\">Gadgetlesstech</span></p><hr style=\"border:none;border-top:1px solid #eee;margin:28px 0;\"><p style=\"font-size:11px;color:#999;\">You received this because you requested the Gadgetlesstech Blueprint. <a href=\"#\" style=\"color:#00b8db;\">Unsubscribe</a></p></div></div></body></html>"
