        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f5f5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><div style=\"max-width:580px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 20px;\"><div style=\"background:#000;padding:20px 28px;border-bottom:3px solid #00b8db;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;\"><p style=\"margin:0;color:#00b8db;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;\">The What</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-weight:900;font-style:italic;letter-spacing:-1px;\">Query Expansion System&#8482;</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:32px 28px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;\"><p>Hey {{ $json.name || 'there' }},</p><p>We built SEO4GEO because we got tired of telling clients they had an SEO problem without being able to show them exactly what it was.</p><p>SEO4GEO is the proof layer of the Gadgetlesstech Ranking System. It does one thing well: it shows you the exact keywords your local competitors rank for that you do not.</p><table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:20px 0;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f5f5;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#00b8db;font-weight:700;\">&#10003;</span> <strong>Keyword Gap Report</strong> &#8212; every keyword your competitor ranks for that you do not</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f5f5;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#00b8db;font-weight:700;\">&#10003;</span> <strong>Competitor Rankings</strong> &#8212; real search data, not estimates</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f5f5;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#00b8db;font-weight:700;\">&#10003;</span> <strong>Local Visibility Score</strong> &#8212; how visible you are vs. your market</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px soli